  "title": "IBM Study: One in Four Malicious Breaches are AI-Enabled, Costing Companies $6 Million on Average",
  "summary": "One in four malicious breaches were AI-enabled – a 56% increase over last year – and these breaches cost an average of $6 million, roughly $1M more than the global breach average of $4.99M, according to IBM's 2026 Cost of a Data Breach Report.",
